  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MMシリーズに新たに加わった第３勢力「マクシオン軍」に、女性型の新機体「スピナティア」がアサシン仕様で登場！",
      "en": "A new female aircraft, \"Spinatia \", is now available as an assassin in the third force \" Maxion Army\" that has newly joined the 30MM series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 30MMシリーズに女性型の素体が新たに登場。",
      "en": "• A new female body has been added to the 30MM series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 素体となる本体のほか、アーマーパーツ、武器パーツがひとつになったオールインワンアイテム。",
      "en": "• An all-in-one item that includes the main body, armor parts, and weapon parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 更に組み立てやすくなった新構造！可動範囲を活かしつつも組み立ての際の挟み込みは一切なし。",
      "en": "• New structure that is even easier to assemble! While taking advantage of the range of motion, there is no pinching during assembly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 既存アイテムともミキシングできる共通関節構造、３mmジョイントを採用。",
      "en": "• Adopts a 3mm joint, a common joint structure that can be mixed with existing items."
    }
